<title>USA: Fed's o/n, 6-day system RPs total $4.5, $6.0 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed's o/n, 6-day system RPs total $4.5, $6.0 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's injection of overnight system and six-day system repurchase agreements totalled $4.500 billion and $6.504 billion, respectively, on Thursday, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Wednesday, the Fed's overnight system RP operation was $6.000 billion.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867</p>
